        "text": "Grill your potatoes! Place them on the grill and cover for 5-7 minutes to get nice charred grill marks. Flip them and grill for another 5-7 minutes or until they are soft and fluffy on the inside when you break them. You can also brush them with more sesame oil when you flip them."
    },
    {
        "text": "Serve with kalbi, bulgogi, grilled lobster, or whatever grilled entree your heart desires! ...Or eat them toasty warm--furtively just as they make their way off the grill and into your mouth. (P.S. If you can control yourself and not eat them all, they even taste great as cold leftovers!)"
